# m3_boss: the M2 sweep, plus the wasm test hooks: god mode at 31 (hits are ignored) and warp
# (waves jump to the boss WARNING). Re-pinned for M7: the Heisenbug has 360 HP in three HP
# phases with a 6 s floor each, so the F1 ship that the old warp at 32 brought could not
# break a phase (P1 timed out after 20 s); the warp is at 1700 now, after the sweep has
# powered up in stage 1. Re-pinned for the catch-up clock (the table runs 4x on a thin field,
# the WARNING lasts 3 s): stage 1's waves come sooner, so by 1700 the sweep has collected F2
# (780), F3 (1292), a fork (1345) and an A (1597: A3, weapon 13). WARNING at 1700 (phase 1),
# the boss spawns at 1881 (phase 2, boss id 0, HP phase 0). Its first HP break (2389) cancels
# the bullets and drops crate 8 (drops 7 -> 8), a fork, which the sweep collects at 2618
# (forks 1 -> 2); the second break (2801) drops crate 9, an A, collected at 2930 (A3 -> A4).
# HP out at 3277, death sequence, then "+500" at 3338: stage_clears 1, the stage index moves
# on to stage 2 (INTEGRATION; debug_stage, the loop, stays 0), and its table starts at 3458
# (phase 0). (Until the catch-up clock: F3 at the warp, boss at 2061, breaks at 2484 and 2939,
# clear at 3662; until M7: warp at 32, clear at 983, debug_stage 1.)
--frames 4000 --call-at "31 debug_god" --call-at "1700 debug_warp" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_stage,debug_stage_index,debug_stage_clears,debug_boss_hp,debug_phase,debug_score --at "100 debug_phase == 0" --at "1699 debug_weapon == 13" --at "1700 debug_phase == 1" --at "1880 debug_boss_id == 255" --at "1881 debug_phase == 2" --at "1881 debug_boss_id == 0" --at "2388 debug_boss_phase == 0" --at "2388 debug_drops == 7" --at "2389 debug_boss_phase == 1" --at "2389 debug_drops == 8" --at "2389 debug_bullets == 0" --at "2617 debug_forks == 1" --at "2618 debug_forks == 2" --at "2800 debug_boss_phase == 1" --at "2801 debug_boss_phase == 2" --at "2801 debug_drops == 9" --at "2929 debug_weapon == 13" --at "2930 debug_weapon == 14" --at "3276 debug_boss_hp > 0" --at "3277 debug_boss_hp == 0" --at "3337 debug_stage_clears == 0" --at "3338 debug_stage_clears == 1" --at "3338 debug_stage_index == 1" --at "3457 debug_phase == 3" --at "3458 debug_phase == 0" --expect "debug_stage_clears == 1" --expect "debug_stage_index == 1" --expect "debug_stage == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_score > 500"
